VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'media and the generosity of my patrons at patreon.com/somegadgetguy. More info on those awesome nerds later in the video. The folks at Fosi Audio sent this my way to test drive and share some thoughts. This is the MD3 Mag DAC.'

[00:26] [scene:hardware]
VISUAL: The Fosi Audio MD3 MagDAC is shown in hand, highlighting its design.
AUDIO: 'It\'s a little portable device that delivers really high-quality audio playback and it has a couple fun lifestyle tricks up its sleeve. Now, I\'m not going to drag this out. It\'s in the name of the product. It has magnets.'

[00:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Magnets. You can stick it to the back of a phone if that phone has magnets or if there\'s some kind of strip in the case. I used it mostly with the magnet case on my OnePlus 15 and on my Vivo X300 Pro. Now, this is a small fun little'

[00:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'rectangle that matches the current phone aesthetic of rounded corners on a metal frame. Got a trio of buttons on one side for menus and volume control, a USB port on the top, then another USB port on the'

